# Data

The dataset (`HOTEL_RESERVATION_DATASET`, 700 rows) was provided by Mentorness for the internship project and is not included in this repo.

| Column | Meaning |
|---|---|
| Booking_ID | Unique reservation ID |
| no_of_adults / no_of_children | Guests per reservation |
| no_of_weekend_nights / no_of_week_nights | Length of stay |
| type_of_meal_plan | Meal plan chosen |
| room_type_reserved | Room type |
| lead_time | Days between booking and arrival |
| arrival_date | Date of arrival |
| market_segment_type | Booking channel (e.g. Online) |
| avg_price_per_room | Average price per room |
| booking_status | Status of the booking |
